				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam ac pacem a deo domino nostro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recte me admonuisti, doctissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, in postrema epistola, quam abs te accepi anno 1534 in mense <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>februario<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wohl die Antwort auf <persName ref="p2448">Pergeners</persName> Brief vom 13. Oktober 1533 (<bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl>, Nr. 272). - Nicht erhalten.</note> ut tandem rationem aut viam, invenire velim, ut literae vestrę <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad nos sępe et nostrę ad vos pervenire possent.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Memorem monuisti, etsi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>curtam suppellectilem ad scribendum precipue latine me habere plane sentio, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nullum tamen laborem tam alacri animo subire velim quam ad homines <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tam pios, doctos, benignos ac humanos sępius dare literas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Urgent fratres <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et huius civitatis tum aliarum civitatum et pręsertim <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemi</placeName>, ut ea, que <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tu scribis, pręstare velim, quibus obluctari piaculum duco.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nactus modo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sum adolescentem mercatorem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt.</note> a <placeName ref="l157">Francfordia</placeName>, qui modo agit in <placeName ref="l1647">Montibus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Chutnis</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><placeName ref="l1647">Kuttenberg (Kutná Hora</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2449">Böhmen</placeName>).</note>, civitate <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemię</placeName> celebri; is promisit sese posthac literas <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nostras deferre <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName>, idque bis in anno, easque bona fide offerre <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> mercatoribus adhibitis pręcibus, ut vobis reddantur in manus, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>facturus his literis periculum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Misi et alias literas ad <persName ref="p467">Martinum Buczerum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName>, rogavi, ut eas <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> mittere velit<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. den Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 15. Februar 1537 (oben <ref target="file10991">Nr. 949</ref>). - Über eine Korrespondenz zwischen <persName ref="p2448">Pergener</persName> und <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note>.<pb type="edition" next="76"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Morem, quem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in cena domini servatis, ex commentariis, quos in caput decimum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ad Hebreos indicasti<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. In piam et eruditam Pauli ad Hebraeos epistolam <persName ref="p495">Heinrychi Bullingeri</persName> commentarius, <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> 1532 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 38), fol. 99r.-113v.</note>, fratribus, qui sunt in <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemia</placeName>, ad verbum exposui; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nam id maxime cupiebant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quanto gaudio perfusi sunt eo audito, alii potius <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>pronunciabunt; mos enim illorum, quem ipsi observare solent in sacratissima <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>domini cena, tam similis est vestro ut ovum ovo<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Siehe Adagia, 1, 5, 10 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 186) und <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 261, Nr. 1318.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Accedit iam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>pręfatio nostri <persName ref="p8171">Theodori</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> in Quattuor libros epistolarum <persName ref="p2442">Iohannis Oeco<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>lampadii</persName> et <persName ref="p4091">Hudelrichii Zvinglii</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Praefatio in: Ioannis Oecolampadii et <persName ref="p4091">Huidrichi Zvinglii</persName> epistolarum libri quatuor, Basel 1536 (<persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 88f, Nr. 182).</note>, in qua et ipse vestrum morem nobis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ignotum esse noluit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Plura scribere volui, optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>; nunctius <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>adstat excepturus literas.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te in primis <persName ref="p8463">Fridericus Weigant</persName>, princeps <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>huius senatus, <placeName ref="l862">Helvetius</placeName>, <persName ref="p5596">Wenceslaus Lankisch</persName>, iudex, <persName ref="p5099">Caspar Guttel</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Wohl <persName ref="p5099">Kaspar Göttling</persName>, Kantor in <placeName ref="l580">Zittau</placeName> von 1536 bis 1553 (vgl. Johannes Günther <hi>Kraner,</hi> <placeName ref="l580">Zittau</placeName>, in: Die Musik in Geschichte und Gegenwart. Allgemeine Enzyklopädie der Musik, Bd. XIV, Kassel 1968, Sp. 1374).</note>, <persName ref="p1412">Onofrius <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Herczog</persName>, <persName ref="p8376">Celestinus Hennig</persName>, <persName ref="p304">Iohannes Becherer</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Der im Brief <persName ref="p2448">Pergeners</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 12. März 1538 wieder genannte Stadtarzt <persName ref="p304">Hans Becherer</persName> war mit einer <placeName ref="l361">Nürnbergerin</placeName> verheiratet (vgl. Zürich StA, E II 367, 12).</note>, cirurgus, <persName ref="p19210">Martinus N.</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Unbekannt.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nostri reipublicae cives, ex <placeName ref="l1172">Lubano</placeName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><placeName ref="l1172">Lauban (Luban</placeName>, <placeName ref="l714">Niederschlesien</placeName>).</note> <persName ref="p4347">Franciscus Boarius</persName> cum suis charissimis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> charissimis <hi>gestrichenes</hi> tandem.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tandem ex <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemia</placeName> perquam multi; ego vero me tibi et admi<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nistris tuis devoveo et addico.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, decus theologię.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l580">Zittae</placeName>, 20. <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>die mensis februarii anno a Christo nato 1<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>537.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2448">Osvaldus Pergenerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ab epistolis publicis<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Unter der Adresse von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:</hi> <persName ref="p2448">Osvaldus Pergenerus</persName>, scriba <placeName ref="l580">Zittensis</placeName>, <placeName ref="l449">Slesita</placeName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo viro domino <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>lingero</persName> cęterisque fratribus verbum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Christi apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> adnunctiantibus, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratribus suis sincere observand<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>is.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
